# An allowlist: the build context is only what the wheel is built from, so a
# local .env, a key or a filled-in prismor.env can never reach a layer or the
# build cache. A new force-include source in pyproject.toml has to be added
# here too -- the wheel build fails on it until it is.
*
!pyproject.toml
!PYPI.md
!LICENSE
!SKILL.md
!immunity-agent.pth
!prismor
!supplychain
!adapters
!advisories
!keys/public.pub
!templates
!docs
!packaging/docker/entrypoint.sh

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[co]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
docs/demo.gif
